---
/**
 * Contact form - email/phone signup for circle notifications
 */
---

<section id="kontakt" class="section" aria-labelledby="kontakt-title">
  <div class="container contact">
    <h3 id="kontakt-title">Nechceš byť v ďalšej WhatsApp skupine?</h3>
    <p>
      Chápeme to. Ak chceš len vedieť, kedy a kde sa koná najbližší kruh,
      nechaj nám na seba kontakt. Posielame <strong>len</strong> pozvánku na
      najbližší kruh. Žiadny spam, žiadne motivačné citáty.
    </p>

    <form class="contact__form" method="post" action="#" novalidate>
      <div class="contact__fields">
        <div>
          <label for="form-meno" class="sr-only">Meno</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="form-meno"
            name="meno"
            placeholder="Meno"
            maxlength="256"
            required
            class="form-field"
            autocomplete="name"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="form-email" class="sr-only">E-mail</label>
          <input
            type="email"
            id="form-email"
            name="email"
            placeholder="E-mail (voliteľne)"
            maxlength="128"
            class="form-field"
            autocomplete="email"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="form-phone" class="sr-only">Telefón</label>
          <input
            type="tel"
            id="form-phone"
            name="telefon"
            placeholder="Telefón (voliteľne)"
            pattern="[0-9\-\(\)+ #*]+"
            minlength="7"
            maxlength="28"
            class="form-field"
            autocomplete="tel"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="contact__hint">
        <strong>Vyplň aspoň jedno z toho.</strong>
      </p>
      <p class="contact__privacy">
        <em
          >Tvoje údaje slúžia výhradne na zasielanie informácií o stretnutiach
          Putovného kruhu.</em
        >
      </p>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">
        Chcem dostávať pozvánky
      </button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact {
    max-width: 32rem;
  }

  .contact__form {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .contact__fields {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .contact__hint {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .contact__privacy {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }
</style>
